    "Content": "<p>Use the AKS release tracker to:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>See AKS deployments real time, every week by region</li>\r\n\t<li>See the flow of deployment (SDP) between one region to the next</li>\r\n\t<li>Get links from the page to the current and past release notes&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/aks/release-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more.</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
